> ### Name: windsorize
> ### Title: Winsorize a numeric vector using SD or IQR thresholds
> ### Aliases: windsorize
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> x <- c(rnorm(100), 10, 15, -12)
> 
> # SD-based winsorization
> windsorize(x, method = "sd", sdlim = 2.5)
  [1] -0.626453811  0.183643324 -0.835628612  1.595280802  0.329507772
